1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:05,520
Meet FocusFlow. Plan your goals, focus deeply, and track your progress.

2
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:11,220
Too much on your mind? FocusFlow turns it into a plan you can actually finish.

3
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:17,340
Step one. Create your free account with email or Google, and pick your own username.

4
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:20,766
Step two. Type any big goal.

5
00:00:20,516 --> 00:00:28,360
The AI asks you a few quick questions, then builds a step-by-step roadmap, with every task already prioritized.

6
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:35,420
Step three. Drag your tasks into the order you want, and check them off as you go.

7
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:40,744
Step four. Start a focus session.

8
00:00:40,494 --> 00:00:42,702
Pick 25, 45, or 60 minutes.

9
00:00:42,452 --> 00:00:47,780
When it ends, your session is saved, and a five-minute break is ready.

10
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:53,980
Step five. Your dashboard, analytics, and calendar show exactly how your week is going.

11
00:00:55,200 --> 00:01:00,700
Step six. Create a circle, share the invite code, and build streaks together with friends.

12
00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:04,660
Then share your profile card with one simple link.

13
00:01:05,700 --> 00:01:09,939
FocusFlow. Start free today at focusflowai.site
